# Smoke test for settings (system config UI).
# The version page uses an auto-scrolling LVGL label whose marquee
# offset depends on wall-clock tick timing — even the first frame
# at +200 ms lands at a different scroll position across CI runs.
# Visual screenshots aren't worth the noise here; the scenario just
# exercises the boot / GO_FORWORD / RETURN paths and asserts no crash.

app settings

wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash

action GO_FORWORD
wait_ms 700
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
